<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Standard Federal cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Standard Federal cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- McDonald &amp; Co analyst Fred Cummings said he cut his rating on Standard Federal Bank to underweight from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1-5/8 at 56-3/8 in mid-afternoon exchange trading.</p>
</text>
